-- Identities for the binomial coefficient: Pascal's rule in additive form,
-- the first column, symmetry, positivity below the diagonal, absorption,
-- the factorial form with truncated subtraction, row sums adding up to a
-- power of two, and the hockey-stick identity
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
